WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.219
Module 3: servers under Azure Arc.

2
00:00:02.219 --> 00:00:05.673
Group Policy reached servers
through OU placement,

3
00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:08.163
the same way it reached workstations.

4
00:00:08.163 --> 00:00:10.183
Intune doesn't take over that job,

5
00:00:10.183 --> 00:00:14.375
because Intune's supported platforms
don't include Windows Server.

6
00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:16.763
The cloud equivalent is Azure Arc.

7
00:00:16.763 --> 00:00:20.863
A server outside Azure runs the
Connected Machine agent and appears

8
00:00:20.863 --> 00:00:24.749
as an Azure resource, managed the
way native virtual machines are.

9
00:00:24.749 --> 00:00:27.691
Arc gives the server an
address in the control plane;

10
00:00:27.691 --> 00:00:31.920
everything that makes it governed is
what you then attach to that address.
